WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:09.850
- Okay, I'm Maurice Samuels, the director

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.730
of the Yale Program for
the Study of Antisemitism,

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:15.660
and it's my great pleasure
to welcome you here

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.010
to today's webinar,

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:21.110
part of our Benjamin and
Barbara Zucker Lecture Series.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:24.000
Our speaker is well known to many of us.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.910
Jason Stanley is the
Jacob Urowsky Professor

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.438
of Philosophy at Yale.

00:00:30.438 --> 00:00:32.870
Before coming to Yale in 2013,

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:34.480
he was Distinguished Professor

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.460
in the Department of
Philosophy at Rutgers.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.330
A philosopher of language
and epistemology,

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.020
as well as a social and
political philosopher,

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.890
he's the author of numerous books,

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:49.057
including "Knowledge and
Practical Interests," 2005,

00:00:49.057 --> 00:00:52.017
"Language in Context," 2007,

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:54.200
"Know How," 2011,

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.970
and two more recent books
that touch on aspects

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.257
of our current political situation,

00:00:59.257 --> 00:01:02.000
"How Propaganda Works," 2015,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
and "How Fascism Works: The
Politics of Us and Them," 2018.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.050
And this last one especially has made him

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.810
kind of a media star lately.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.370
I should say that my
colleague Alice Kaplan

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.190
also asked me to point out that Jason,

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.690
along with Tim Snyder,

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:21.410
will be giving a Franke Seminar

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.830
at the Whitney Humanities Center next year

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.590
on mass incarceration in the Soviet Union

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:27.577
and the United States,

00:01:27.577 --> 00:01:30.990
with sidelong looks at
Nazi Germany and China.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.850
So please check the Whitney
Humanities Center website

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:36.240
for more information on that.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.170
Finally, before we get started,

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:41.430
just a word on how things today will work.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.435
Jason will talk for about 30 minutes,

00:01:44.435 --> 00:01:47.550
and then we'll open it up for questions.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:50.510
The audience is not visible or audible,

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:54.650
so please submit your questions
using the Q and A button

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:58.901
at the bottom of your screen,
and I will ask the questions.

00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:01.020
Feel free to submit questions

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.098
whenever you want, even during the talk.

00:02:03.098 --> 00:02:06.343
That would actually be helpful
to me if they came in early.

00:02:06.343 --> 00:02:09.880
Please don't raise your hand
or use the chat functions,

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:13.530
because we won't see them.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.630
So the title of Professor
Stanley's talk today

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:19.620
is "Antisemitism and White Supremacy."

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:21.833
Please join me in welcoming Jason Stanley.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:28.409
- Thank you so much and
thank you for coming.

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:34.510
So I want to talk today
about something that's,

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:40.150
about growing antisemitism
in the United States

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.450
and the structure and how it relates

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.761
to what's going on in the world today

00:02:46.761 --> 00:02:51.133
and our own very particular
political situation,

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.630
our own particular, in particular,

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.720
our history of white supremacy.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.430
So let's begin with what's going on.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:02.613
I'm gonna begin with the
international situation,

00:03:05.912 --> 00:03:08.720
with one aspect of the
international situation,

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.196
and then I'm gonna talk a little bit

00:03:10.196 --> 00:03:14.350
about what we face with white
supremacy in the United States

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:16.950
against Black Americans.

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:18.645
And then I'm going to connect this

00:03:18.645 --> 00:03:22.070
to the topic of today, antisemitism.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:27.070
So as my colleague Elli Stern
has been drawing our attention

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.320
to a global move in many countries,

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.150
not yet in the United States,

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:35.250
of Jewish voters to right wing,

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.837
often anti-immigrant parties,

00:03:37.837 --> 00:03:40.420
somewhat xenophobic parties,

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:45.053
which movement that you see in Europe,

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:50.440
and certainly there is, of
course, a far right in Israel.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:54.440
This belies a long
history of Jewish voters,

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:58.030
Jewish participation, since emancipation

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:03.030
on being on the side of
ethnic religious minorities

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.503
that were not themselves.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.900
But we don't have this movement in the...

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.500
It's sort of divided here.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.850
So we have a lot of Orthodox voters

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:20.410
supporting far right
parties, far right movements,

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:24.320
but it's less of, but we still have

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:29.320
a majority liberal progressive
voting constituency.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.210
Now let's turn...

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:37.210
So there is this move across
the world towards a kind of...

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.720
that seems like a
repudiation of a long history

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.040
of recognizing a common alliance

00:04:44.243 --> 00:04:49.130
between Jewish fate in a country

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:52.383
and the fate of other minority groups.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:57.971
Partly, there is a
country that is a Jewish,

00:04:57.971 --> 00:05:02.590
that is, Israel exists now.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:04.510
And so that gives a sort of,

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.914
now that there's a nationalist movement,

00:05:06.914 --> 00:05:10.893
there's a nation that is
associated with the religion.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:16.410
But whatever the explanations of that,

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.860
my topic here is the United States,

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:22.793
is focused on what's going
on in the United States.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.430
So I'm gonna quickly
review some basic facts

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:33.460
and then I'm going to talk
about what antisemitism,

00:05:34.304 --> 00:05:39.130
what one structure of
antisemitism looks like

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:43.650
that's shared between the
"Protocols of the Elders of Zion,"

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.060
and say, Henry Ford's
"The International Jew,"

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:50.310
and the Ku Klux Klan, and how
that links Jewish Americans

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.540
to our Black fellow citizens,

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:59.650
whether Jewish or not,
and what's happening.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:04.650
And then I'm going to conclude
by looking at the anti...

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.930
Talking about QAnon,

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:09.980
talking about the kind
of growing antisemitism

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:13.963
that we're finding, particularly
in the Republican Party,

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.560
among certain members
of the Republican Party.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:24.777
We already see it with open
George Soros vilification.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:31.280
So when Viktor Orban ran a
political campaign against,

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:38.010
condemning George Soros,
against George Soros in Hungary,

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:41.380
it was clearly recognized as antisemitic.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:44.650
Now, Giuliani and many other Republicans

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:47.580
can condemn George Soros openly

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:52.580
as behind every bad thing and
link him, in exactly the ways

00:06:52.651 --> 00:06:56.160
that antisemitic conspiracy
theories link Jews

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:01.160
to minority groups, and no
one seems to bat an eye.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.730
And I'm going to argue

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:07.033
this is an extraordinarily
dangerous development

00:07:07.033 --> 00:07:12.033
for the safety and
security of American Jews.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.230
Sorry, I'm trying to...

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:16.063
Ah, here we go.

00:07:16.063 --> 00:07:19.350
So, so let me begin.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.610
So what's going on,

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:24.810
let's just review some
history in the United States.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.920
So when I last,

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:30.150
so we all know that this country is based,

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:33.880
it has a long history
of explicit enslavement

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.900
of its Black population.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:40.900
And then we, in many
senses, were not a democracy

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.490
until the Voting Rights Act,

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:46.380
until Black Americans in
the South were able to vote.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:50.720
And we're seeing this rise again

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.520
with voter disenfranchisement focusing

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:56.186
on Black majority cities.

00:07:56.186 --> 00:08:01.186
Trump declared the voter
fraud to be focused

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:05.820
in Detroit, Atlanta,
Philadelphia, Milwaukee.

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.230
This was no accident.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.230
These are either Black majority cities

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.040
or cities with large Black populations.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:17.040
So he was hearkening back
to a long standing practice

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:19.780
in the United States that Black...

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:21.280
And the Black radical tradition

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:25.310
was always linked with fascism.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.770
Toni Morrison in a 1995 speech

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:30.800
at Howard University talks of,

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:34.890
called "Racism and Fascism,"
points, says that...

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.500
She says "The United States..."

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.370
She doesn't say the United
States is a fascist regime.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.766
She says that the United States has often

00:08:41.766 --> 00:08:46.248
preferred fascist solutions
to its national problems.

00:08:46.248 --> 00:08:48.330
And what are the fascist solutions?

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:51.740
She said, "Taking the minority population

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:54.727
and incarcerating them in large numbers."

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.510
Now, if we look at,

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:02.127
so these parallels
between European fascism

00:09:03.921 --> 00:09:06.410
and say, the Jim Crow South,

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.900
have been explored in
detail by my Yale colleague,

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:12.090
Jim Whitman in his book
"Hitler's American Model,"

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.960
the Nuremberg laws were, of course,

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.513
modeled on our anti-miscegenation laws.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.133
And I just recently found out,

00:09:20.133 --> 00:09:23.930
when UMass digitalized Du Bois' archives,

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.710
that WEB Du Bois had a piece rejected

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:31.640
from "The Atlantic" in 1942
where he made a direct analogy

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.170
between Hitler's treatment of Jews

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.810
and the South's treatment
of Black Americans.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:42.580
So the tradition of the
mainstream press repudiating

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.050
these analogies is also old.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:50.050
So in 2014, with my then
colleague, Vesla Weaver,

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:54.570
I looked at the numbers
for mass incarceration

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.703
in the United States.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:00.265
As you may know, the United
States leads the world

00:10:00.265 --> 00:10:04.183
in the rate at which it
incarcerates its fellow citizens.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.760
So looking at these numbers, what we found

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:18.430
was if you just looked at the
Black population in prison,

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.713
I think we have 38
million Black Americans,

00:10:25.612 --> 00:10:28.720
they're incarcerated at such a high rate

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:32.850
that in 2014 they formed almost 10%

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:36.100
of the world's prison population.

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.390
Whenever I say that,

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:40.551
people say there must be
some misunderstanding.

00:10:40.551 --> 00:10:43.890
There must be some misstatement.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.980
But it's not a misstatement.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.040
In 2014, Black Americans,

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.930
a tiny, tiny group formed almost 10%

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:55.350
of the world's prison population.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:59.500
So when we talk about
racism and white supremacy,

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.930
this is not some kind of past problem.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.350
It's not a problem locatable

00:11:06.677 --> 00:11:09.810
to lack of diversity among faculty,

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:14.810
although it is also present
there, or in professions.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.910
Almost 10% of the world's
prison population comes

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:22.910
from the population of 38
million Black Americans.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:29.120
If Germany had had a substantial
population of German Jews

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.880
and was incarcerating them at rates

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.090
like we see in the United States,

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.840
the world would never stand for it.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.280
So obviously, there is an enormous,

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:42.050
unresolved continuing problem of racism

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.253
in the United States.

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:48.840
That's multifactorial,
linked to many issues.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.660
But the facts are the facts.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:56.660
So what does this have
to do with antisemitism?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.960
Well, I want now to move

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.513
to what may seem like a different topic.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.170
I'm gonna sit down again,

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:11.253
because, as they tell me on interviews,

00:12:12.473 --> 00:12:17.473
I sometimes look like I'm
davening when I'm standing up.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:22.770
So let's go back to the structure

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.817
of the antisematic conspiracy theory,

00:12:24.817 --> 00:12:27.147
"The Protocols of the Elders of Zion."

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.364
So "The Protocols of
the Elders of Zion says

00:12:32.364 --> 00:12:37.364
that there's a global conspiracy
of Jews, of elite Jews

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:45.360
who are seeking to advance
social justice movements

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.253
to break apart nations.

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:52.670
In the words of...

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:55.840
And "Protocols" says that movements

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.040
for universal social justice,

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:01.330
universal rights, rights
for minority groups,

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:04.610
rights for women always have this global,

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:08.050
this unholy alliance of capitalist Jews

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.913
and communist Jews behind them.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:16.500
So the idea is that the central idea

00:13:17.082 --> 00:13:20.082
of "The Protocols of the Elders
of Zion" is that liberalism,

00:13:21.937 --> 00:13:24.990
moves for social justice
for minority groups,

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:29.990
religious, gender equality, gay rights,

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:37.559
that these always have behind
them this conspiracy of Jews.

00:13:37.559 --> 00:13:41.260
And the goal is to
destroy the nation states

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.773
and replace it with world government.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:50.310
Now, if you look at the
ideology of the Second Klan

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:52.933
in the 1920s in the United States,

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:57.870
you will find a remarkably similar story.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:02.040
This has been explored in
Nancy MacLean's 1994 book.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.730
She has a chapter on the overlaps

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:07.559
between the ideology of
the Klan in the 1920s

00:14:07.559 --> 00:14:11.720
and the growing Nazi ideology.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:15.800
Sarah Churchwell has also
explored this in her work

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:18.400
on interwar fascism in the United States.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.610
Indeed, many newspapers,

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:24.200
as Sarah Churchwell notes, thought of...

00:14:25.512 --> 00:14:26.870
The Italian fascists were described

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:29.610
as a kind of Italian Ku Klux Klan.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.889
So Klan ideology had it

00:14:31.889 --> 00:14:36.889
that Jews were behind
movements for Black equality

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.480
and were behind the labor movement.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:45.480
And the labor movement was a
method of destroying capitalism

00:14:47.667 --> 00:14:51.990
and forcing Black Americans
and white Americans

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:55.460
to work side by side as
brothers and sisters.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:15:00.300
And the idea was that Jews were
bringing, were trying to...

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.860
And the basic thought is Jews are trying

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:05.100
to foment racial division
so they could take over.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.570
So the Klan ideology is very similar

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:09.440
to "The Protocols of the Elders of Zion."

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.550
And you find, and it's
no surprise, of course,

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:15.420
that Henry Ford distributed
"The International Jew,"

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:17.210
hundreds of thousands of copies,

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.993
which has a similar ideology.

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:23.540
Now, what I'm going to do is
I'm gonna show you a video

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:24.740
that was...

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:28.380
I'm gonna show you stills from a video

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:32.703
that was shown right after
Rudy Giuliani's speech

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:38.710
at the January 6th rally,
Stop the Steal rally

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.163
in Washington, DC.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.857
And now that you have this understanding

00:15:43.857 --> 00:15:48.857
that Jews, the global
Jews, the global elite,

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.090
are there trying to...

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:55.760
And their goal is to
undermine white Christianity

00:15:55.760 --> 00:16:00.760
by creating racial divisions
and undermining society

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.050
so they can take over.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.670
I want you to think about that

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:08.081
as we look at some of these stills.

00:16:08.081 --> 00:16:11.399
So this was directly
after Giuliani's speech,

00:16:11.399 --> 00:16:14.861
and soon before Trump's speech
that culminated the rally,

00:16:14.861 --> 00:16:17.400
when people marched to the US Capitol.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.900
And I spend a lot of time
on far right websites.

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:23.000
There is a division between the far right

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.763
about what to think about Jews.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.840
There's one group that's
like separate but equal,

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:33.147
Israel is fine, you know,
but another group says,

00:16:33.147 --> 00:16:35.647
"No, they're always bad."

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:38.310
