00:46:21.450 --> 00:46:24.980
And Stern talks about how
we need to pay attention

00:46:24.980 --> 00:46:27.310
to the fact that many Jewish people

00:46:27.310 --> 00:46:29.580
might not themselves be Orthodox,

00:46:29.580 --> 00:46:34.580
but yet they're part of an
Orthodox community of values.

00:46:35.559 --> 00:46:38.690
And so there are many common interests

00:46:38.690 --> 00:46:40.880
between fundamentalist religious groups.

00:46:40.880 --> 00:46:42.490
I mean, it was a great,

00:46:42.490 --> 00:46:46.510
it's really a mystery to me
that the Republican Party

00:46:46.510 --> 00:46:51.510
has not appealed to Muslim Americans,

00:46:51.840 --> 00:46:55.476
an incredibly wealthy,
prosperous, successful group,

00:46:55.476 --> 00:46:59.940
which does have groups, sub groups,

00:46:59.940 --> 00:47:04.200
that that would be naturally
Republican, like Orthodox Jews.

00:47:04.200 --> 00:47:05.440
It should be no surprise

00:47:06.960 --> 00:47:11.960
that very religious groups
have common interests.

00:47:12.760 --> 00:47:14.040
And what we see is that.

00:47:14.040 --> 00:47:14.873
- Right.

00:47:14.873 --> 00:47:18.083
And that, you know, I
think does explain some

00:47:18.083 --> 00:47:19.610
of what took a lot of people by surprise,

00:47:19.610 --> 00:47:24.610
which was a certain Latino vote for Trump,

00:47:24.920 --> 00:47:29.920
which shocked people, but
conservative Catholics...

00:47:30.390 --> 00:47:32.260
And there is actually a question about...

00:47:32.260 --> 00:47:34.010
which is not exactly the same thing,

00:47:34.010 --> 00:47:39.010
but about the intersection
between right wing Catholicism,

00:47:39.350 --> 00:47:42.630
like extreme, you know,
that kind of extreme brand

00:47:42.630 --> 00:47:46.320
that Steve Bannon and
Michael Flynn had been part,

00:47:46.320 --> 00:47:50.360
you know, and QAnon, and this phenomenon

00:47:50.360 --> 00:47:52.230
that you're talking about.

00:47:52.230 --> 00:47:55.560
- I want to say one more
thing about antisemitism,

00:47:55.560 --> 00:48:00.123
about right wing, about
antisemitism even among Jews.

00:48:01.930 --> 00:48:05.893
I was told recently
that it's Ashkenazi Jews

00:48:05.893 --> 00:48:08.390
who often get subject to this.

00:48:08.390 --> 00:48:13.390
- Okay, so a question about
what to say to people who say,

00:48:13.997 --> 00:48:17.780
"Well, Trumpism can't be fundamentally...

00:48:17.780 --> 00:48:20.572
there can't be antisemitism
in it because look,

00:48:20.572 --> 00:48:24.397
Trump's own grandchildren are Jewish."

00:48:25.430 --> 00:48:28.090
Jared and Ivanka are Orthodox Jews.

00:48:28.090 --> 00:48:30.943
How do you respond to
think about question?

00:48:33.230 --> 00:48:34.380
- I mean, I think, again,

00:48:34.380 --> 00:48:37.840
it helps to think about race here,

00:48:37.840 --> 00:48:41.130
where many, I mean, I'm not talking

00:48:41.130 --> 00:48:42.860
about what is in Trump's heart.

00:48:42.860 --> 00:48:46.887
Trump himself says many
things that are, you know...

00:48:46.887 --> 00:48:48.997
"Do I want Jews counting my money?"

00:48:51.350 --> 00:48:54.063
Speaking to Jewish audiences,
talking about greed.

00:48:55.170 --> 00:48:59.000
So, I mean, I think that the fact is

00:48:59.000 --> 00:49:03.374
that you can be a white person married,

00:49:03.374 --> 00:49:07.507
with a Black grandchild
and still be racist.

00:49:09.934 --> 00:49:12.790
I'm not saying Trump is antisemitic,

00:49:12.790 --> 00:49:17.167
but I'm saying the fact that
he has a Jewish son-in-law

00:49:20.490 --> 00:49:23.280
who repeatedly is referred
to as the globalist member,

00:49:23.280 --> 00:49:27.460
of the cabinet, does not mean

00:49:27.460 --> 00:49:30.250
that he's not using antisemitic policies,

00:49:30.250 --> 00:49:33.280
I mean, politics, engaged
in antisemitic politics.

00:49:33.280 --> 00:49:34.460
I think there's no question

00:49:34.460 --> 00:49:37.810
we're seeing antisemitic
politics and tactics being used.

00:49:37.810 --> 00:49:40.690
Let's stop asking what's
in people's hearts

00:49:40.690 --> 00:49:43.050
and start asking what they're doing,

00:49:43.050 --> 00:49:45.338
what they're doing to retain power.

00:49:45.338 --> 00:49:50.338
Antisemitism is always, and
will always be a powerful way

00:49:51.570 --> 00:49:53.703
to grab power in a country.

00:49:54.902 --> 00:49:57.900
Spreading conspiracy theories where,

00:49:57.900 --> 00:50:02.900
my theory of antisemitism, I
lean toward a theory that says,

00:50:04.474 --> 00:50:06.700
a young philosopher named Joshua
Stein is working this out,

00:50:06.700 --> 00:50:10.330
that Jews are the center
of any conspiracy theory.

00:50:10.330 --> 00:50:13.020
They're the group that it's aimed at.

00:50:13.020 --> 00:50:14.260
And I think that that kind of,

00:50:14.260 --> 00:50:17.590
if we think of fascism,
as I do in my work,

00:50:17.590 --> 00:50:20.030
as a set of tactics to retain power,

00:50:20.030 --> 00:50:22.998
we realize like, somebody
like an Israeli politician

00:50:22.998 --> 00:50:24.940
can use those tactics.

00:50:24.940 --> 00:50:28.330
There was a terrific article
in "The Intercept" years ago,

00:50:28.330 --> 00:50:32.360
which is now scrubbed away,

00:50:32.360 --> 00:50:35.990
called "How Steve Bannon made Breitbart

00:50:35.990 --> 00:50:40.187
into a Pro-Israel Haven for Antisemites."

00:50:41.083 --> 00:50:43.629
And the comments was all antisemites.

00:50:43.629 --> 00:50:46.370
And it talked about how in Israel,

00:50:46.370 --> 00:50:49.450
there was lots and lots of
antisemitic propaganda aimed

00:50:49.450 --> 00:50:52.140
at left, Labor politicians,

00:50:52.140 --> 00:50:54.470
very explicit antisemitic propaganda.

00:50:54.470 --> 00:50:57.830
because who knows antisemitic propaganda

00:50:57.830 --> 00:50:59.910
and how to use it better than

00:51:00.880 --> 00:51:02.280
I mean, better than, you know,

00:51:02.280 --> 00:51:04.690
I was raised being told
about it by my parents.

00:51:04.690 --> 00:51:07.700
- Mm-hmm, okay. So there
are a lot of questions.

00:51:07.700 --> 00:51:09.600
And I, first of all, let me apologize

00:51:09.600 --> 00:51:10.560
because I'm not gonna be able to get

00:51:10.560 --> 00:51:11.620
to all of these questions.

00:51:11.620 --> 00:51:13.090
There are so many questions,

00:51:13.090 --> 00:51:16.410
which is really a sign of
how engaged this audience is,

00:51:16.410 --> 00:51:19.750
which is great, but there
are a lot of questions about,

00:51:19.750 --> 00:51:24.750
they basically boil down to
what can we do about this?

00:51:25.260 --> 00:51:30.260
What kind of practical or
even philosophical resistance

00:51:30.580 --> 00:51:35.580
can we offer to the situation
that you're outlining here?

00:51:36.200 --> 00:51:41.200
- I think that antisemitism,
racism, these ills, rise in,

00:51:42.880 --> 00:51:45.033
but especially antisemitism,

00:51:46.610 --> 00:51:49.820
rises in conditions where
people feel the government

00:51:49.820 --> 00:51:54.300
has betrayed them, where the
government is really in control

00:51:54.300 --> 00:51:57.000
by some elites who are benefiting.

00:51:57.000 --> 00:51:59.690
And I think the number one thing we can do

00:51:59.690 --> 00:52:03.220
to stem antisemitism is a massive program

00:52:03.220 --> 00:52:06.825
to make government work
again in the face of COVID.

00:52:06.825 --> 00:52:09.850
You will never eliminate
antisemitism as an ill,

00:52:09.850 --> 00:52:14.195
that is, I think, tragically permanent.

00:52:14.195 --> 00:52:17.473
But wait, we're echoing.

00:52:18.682 --> 00:52:20.121
Do you hear an echo?

00:52:20.121 --> 00:52:21.915
- No, no.

00:52:21.915 --> 00:52:26.650
- So, but I think that in
moments of enormous anxiety,

00:52:26.650 --> 00:52:29.720
economic enormous anxiety, fear,

00:52:29.720 --> 00:52:33.780
the feeling that your government
has deeply betrayed you,

00:52:33.780 --> 00:52:38.780
this tends to lead to an
increase in antisemitism,

00:52:39.493 --> 00:52:42.250
blaming certain groups, with the Jews...

00:52:42.250 --> 00:52:44.685
So if there's this, the
elite have betrayed us,

00:52:44.685 --> 00:52:46.950
they've betrayed us,
they're funneling our money,

00:52:46.950 --> 00:52:48.960
they're dividing us, they're betraying us.

00:52:48.960 --> 00:52:53.960
So if we can address the
racial division in our country,

00:52:55.550 --> 00:52:59.760
if we can address racial
injustice and tamp down the sort

00:52:59.760 --> 00:53:04.760
of supposedly outward signs
of what the Jews are doing

00:53:05.803 --> 00:53:09.170
by addressing racial inequality

00:53:09.170 --> 00:53:13.360
and the horrific conditions
facing many Black Americans,

00:53:13.360 --> 00:53:17.090
and then direct, show that
the government is working

00:53:17.090 --> 00:53:20.900
for all Americans, rural,
urban, in the face of COVID,

00:53:20.900 --> 00:53:23.340
then you will cut down the base.

00:53:23.340 --> 00:53:24.903
You'll do problem dissolution.

00:53:26.513 --> 00:53:27.800
- Mm-hmm, very interesting.

00:53:27.800 --> 00:53:29.597
And one thing people have pointed out,

00:53:29.597 --> 00:53:32.120
and I want to give you
the chance to say this,

00:53:32.120 --> 00:53:37.120
that you're not saying that
all Orthodox Jews are racist

00:53:38.890 --> 00:53:41.239
or anything like that.
- Oh, no.

00:53:41.239 --> 00:53:43.270
- So just, and in fact
there are many branches--

00:53:43.270 --> 00:53:45.021
- No Orthodox, absolutely not,

00:53:45.021 --> 00:53:49.230
or involved in any sense in racism.

00:53:49.230 --> 00:53:51.010
I'm saying they too will be,

00:53:51.010 --> 00:53:53.460
we all, Orthodox and non-Orthodox Jews,

00:53:53.460 --> 00:53:58.120
will be targets of a growing
white supremacist movement.

00:53:58.120 --> 00:54:01.410
Of course, I don't think Orthodox...

00:54:02.460 --> 00:54:07.340
What I was talking, and I'm not
even, yeah, I don't think...

00:54:07.340 --> 00:54:09.490
I don't think when Orthodox Jews vote

00:54:09.490 --> 00:54:11.930
for Trump they're voting...

00:54:11.930 --> 00:54:13.110
I mean, there's a racism problem

00:54:13.110 --> 00:54:15.770
among all white
communities, let's face it.

00:54:15.770 --> 00:54:18.290
I mean, all white communities in America

00:54:18.290 --> 00:54:19.704
have a racism problem.

00:54:19.704 --> 00:54:23.280
You know, so I don't
want to exonerate either.

00:54:23.280 --> 00:54:24.930
And it's on Orthodox and non-Orthodox.

00:54:24.930 --> 00:54:28.600
There are plenty of people
who deny that racism,

00:54:28.600 --> 00:54:33.600
despite vast evidence of massive
racial inequality at birth,

00:54:35.084 --> 00:54:39.100
racial wealth gaps,
enormous racial wealth gaps,

00:54:39.100 --> 00:54:41.205
and 10 to 20 to one,

00:54:41.205 --> 00:54:43.950
all white communities are implicated.

00:54:43.950 --> 00:54:47.810
But I don't see Orthodox
Jews or non-Orthodox Jews

00:54:47.810 --> 00:54:49.109
any more implicated,

00:54:49.109 --> 00:54:52.463
and our Black Orthodox Jews that I know.

00:54:55.680 --> 00:55:00.140
But I don't see Orthodox
communities implicated

00:55:00.140 --> 00:55:03.130
in racism any more than any other group

00:55:03.130 --> 00:55:06.410
that is majority white.

00:55:06.410 --> 00:55:10.240
But let's face it, if
you want the government

00:55:10.240 --> 00:55:12.830
to pay for private
schools for your people,

00:55:12.830 --> 00:55:14.510
and that's your primary interest,

00:55:14.510 --> 00:55:17.430
you are implicated in
racism in the United States

00:55:17.430 --> 00:55:19.730
because we need the government.

00:55:19.730 --> 00:55:24.730
We need funds to go to
people who don't have,

00:55:24.890 --> 00:55:28.300
who have been historically
unjustly oppressed

00:55:28.300 --> 00:55:29.400
and subjugated.

00:55:29.400 --> 00:55:31.270
And so if you're in any community,

00:55:31.270 --> 00:55:34.558
be it a white Christian
community, an Islamic community,

00:55:34.558 --> 00:55:36.850
a Hindu community, a Jewish community

00:55:36.850 --> 00:55:38.558
that is pushing for certain policies

00:55:38.558 --> 00:55:42.680
that are going to have
downstream negative effects,

00:55:42.680 --> 00:55:47.600
like paying for schools
just for your own group,

00:55:47.600 --> 00:55:49.740
rather than addressing inequalities,

00:55:49.740 --> 00:55:51.910
you're gonna be implicated.

00:55:51.910 --> 00:55:53.300
- Okay, and the last question,

00:55:53.300 --> 00:55:54.610
'cause we're almost out of time,

00:55:54.610 --> 00:55:58.720
but do you feel that the fact

00:55:58.720 --> 00:56:01.040
that the Trump
administration is behind us,

00:56:01.040 --> 00:56:04.210
that we're now starting
the Biden administration,

00:56:04.210 --> 00:56:08.280
is that a cause for hope,
I mean, in the sense

00:56:08.280 --> 00:56:11.427
that these, antisemitism

00:56:13.610 --> 00:56:17.590
and this rhetoric might
dissipate a little bit,

00:56:17.590 --> 00:56:19.750
or do you see it as, you know,

00:56:19.750 --> 00:56:23.210
is the rage and Stop the Steal anger

00:56:23.210 --> 00:56:25.310
gonna actually make it worse?

00:56:25.310 --> 00:56:28.080
- I think that antisemitism is an ill

00:56:28.080 --> 00:56:30.100
that is permanent in American society,

00:56:30.100 --> 00:56:32.080
and in many societies, it lay dormant.

00:56:32.080 --> 00:56:34.760
This is a country in which
we have been flourished

00:56:34.760 --> 00:56:36.304
like almost no other country,

00:56:36.304 --> 00:56:39.050
but it's like playing with fire.

00:56:39.050 --> 00:56:41.690
And so it's out now,

00:56:41.690 --> 00:56:43.910
it's out in very open ways

00:56:43.910 --> 00:56:47.200
that have never been
this open in my lifetime.

00:56:47.200 --> 00:56:52.200
And it threatens and
it's gonna be the basis,

00:56:53.292 --> 00:56:57.260
and we have many QAnon
supporters openly in Congress,

00:56:57.260 --> 00:56:58.940
and I've never seen anything like it.

00:56:58.940 --> 00:57:02.240
And the conditions, that we
have like 15 months to deal

00:57:02.240 --> 00:57:04.850
with the social basis of mistrust

00:57:04.850 --> 00:57:09.780
that we know from history
feeds antisemitism

00:57:09.780 --> 00:57:13.150
in far right ethnonationalist movements.

00:57:13.150 --> 00:57:18.150
So, no, I feel it could be
the calm before the storm.

00:57:18.430 --> 00:57:19.272
- Yeah, okay.

00:57:19.272 --> 00:57:22.720
Well, on that note,
please join me, everyone,

00:57:22.720 --> 00:57:26.290
in silently thanking
Professor Jason Stanley

00:57:26.290 --> 00:57:31.290
for what was really a very
stimulating and fascinating talk.

00:57:31.870 --> 00:57:34.380
So thank you, Jason, for doing this

00:57:34.380 --> 00:57:36.100
and especially on such short notice

00:57:36.100 --> 00:57:38.440
and yes, thank you.

00:57:38.440 --> 00:57:40.433
So--
- Thank you so much.

